{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"lexyacc","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Lex and Yacc","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Lex and Yacc (.l .y .lex .yacc).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"lexyacc","name":"Lex and Yacc","extensions":[".l",".y",".lex",".yacc",".yy",".ll"],"grammar":"grammars/lexyacc.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Lex and Yacc","path":"snippets/lexyacc.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/lexyacc.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^%%$|^%\\\\{|^%\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"%(?:token|left|right|nonassoc|type|union|start|prec|option|x|s|define|expect|code|destructor|param|require|glr-parser|locations|pure-parser|define)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\$\\\\$|\\\\$[0-9]+|@\\\\$|@[0-9]+\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]+\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^[a-z_]\\\\w*(?=\\\\s*:)\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\[[^\\\\]]*\\\\]\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/lexyacc.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Lex file\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lex\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"%{\",\n      \"#include <stdio.h>\",\n      \"%}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"%%\",\n      \"${1:[0-9]+}    { $0 }\",\n      \"%%\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A flex skeleton\"\n  },\n  \"Yacc rule\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rule\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"${1:expr}: ${2:expr} '+' ${2:expr} { \\\\$\\\\$ = \\\\$1 + \\\\$3; }\",\n      \"     | NUMBER\",\n      \"     ;\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A grammar rule\"\n  },\n  \"Token\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"token\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"%token ${1:NUMBER}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Declare tokens\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Lex and Yacc\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Lex and Yacc.\n\n## Files\n\n`.l`, `.y`, `.lex`, `.yacc`, `.yy`, `.ll`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `lex` | A flex skeleton |\n| `rule` | A grammar rule |\n| `token` | Declare tokens |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}